f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e690f802ed6909fadf71","start":323,"end":340,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-7e9f225b29a75cdfacfa","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-015fe050c1e38820e503","layer":"pei","quote":"商谓璋曰：‘超勇而不仁，见得不思义，不可以为唇齿。《老子》曰：“国之利器，不可以示人。”今之益部，士美民丰，宝物所出；斯乃狡夫所欲倾覆，超等所以西望也。若引而近之，则犹养虎，将自遗患矣","attribution":"裴注·益州耆旧传","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e690f802ed6909fadf71","start":127,"end":219,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-83b89b87fc1ec0942500","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-015fe050c1e38820e503","layer":"pei","quote":"璋以商为蜀郡大守","attribution":"裴注·益州耆旧传","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e690f802ed6909fadf71","start":293,"end":301,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-90a911ba6d1fe7943dd5","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-cac4f12c6d2cdc2db0fe","layer":"original","quote":"后商为严君平、李弘立祠","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":275,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-a8208f813c95226b5e3c","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-015fe050c1e38820e503","layer":"pei","quote":"许靖号为臧否，至蜀，见商而称之曰：‘设使商生于华夏，虽王景兴无以加也","attribution":"裴注·益州耆旧传","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e690f802ed6909fadf71","start":257,"end":291,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-b6de3a4f9a9e7b15dac8","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-e08a11ef44a06a01291a","layer":"original","quote":"南阳宋仲子〖90〗，于荆州与蜀郡太守王商书曰：“文休倜傥瑰玮〖91〗，有当世之具〖92〗；足下当以为指南","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-ddc957683eddd3b5e19a","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-015fe050c1e38820e503","layer":"pei","quote":"成都禽坚，有至孝之行，商表其墓，追赠孝廉","attribution":"裴注·益州耆旧传","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e690f802ed6909fadf71","start":302,"end":322,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-e1f48e8ff5f9c51f7fd0","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-015fe050c1e38820e503","layer":"pei","quote":"荆州牧刘表及儒者宋忠，咸闻其名，遗书与商，叙致殷勤","attribution":"裴注·益州耆旧传","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e690f802ed6909fadf71","start":231,"end":256,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-e497ede3dc2087e2b2d5","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-015fe050c1e38820e503","layer":"pei","quote":"许靖代之","attribution":"裴注·益州耆旧传","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e690f802ed6909fadf71","start":360,"end":364,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-f4a8475ac9564039b74c","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-aa29eda8f12dbb3b4dec","layer":"original","quote":"建安十六年，转在蜀郡","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q2-c7f038cbe775c4ce6a04","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-cac4f12c6d2cdc2db0fe","layer":"original","quote":"后商为严君平、李弘立祠〖17〗。宓与书曰：“疾病伏匿〖18〗；甫知足下为严、李立祠，可谓厚党勤类者也〖19〗。观严文章，冠冒天下；由、夷逸操〖20〗，山岳不移；使扬子不叹〖21〗，固自昭明。如李仲元不遭《法言》〖22〗，令名必沦〖23〗；其无虎豹之文故也〖24〗：可谓攀龙附凤者矣〖25〗。如扬子云潜心著述，有补于世；泥蟠不滓〖26〗，行参圣师〖27〗；于今海内，谈咏厥辞〖28〗。邦有斯人，以耀四远；怪子替兹〖29〗，不立祠堂。蜀本无学士，文翁遣相如东受七经〖30〗，还教吏民；于是蜀学比于齐、鲁。故《地（里）〔理〕志》曰〖31〗：‘文翁倡其教，相如为之师。’汉家得士，盛于其世。仲舒之徒〖32〗，不达封禅〖33〗，相如制其礼；夫能制礼造乐，移风易俗，非《礼》所秩有益于世者乎〖34〗？虽有王孙之累〖35〗；犹孔子大齐桓之霸〖36〗，公羊贤叔术之让〖37〗，仆亦善长卿之化。宜立祠堂，速定其铭。”","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":275,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":399,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q2-ecfae9ea412c4099347a","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-e08a11ef44a06a01291a","layer":"original","quote":"后刘璋遂使使招靖，靖来入蜀，璋以靖为巴郡、广汉太守。南阳宋仲子〖90〗，于荆州与蜀郡太守王商书曰：“文休倜傥瑰玮〖91〗，有当世之具〖92〗；足下当以为指南〖93〗。”﹝五﹞","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
